        "username": "Thunderbird",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/ba8739/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2024-10-19T16:08:53.890Z",
        "cooked": "<p>My lost item(s) are at Taco Bell, also fallen from grace. The 7-Layer Burrito, its associated Crunchwrap, and later the Fiesta Veggie Burrito from the value menu, which is but a shadow of its former self. What’s worse is they have all these ingredients still since every “new” menu item is just another recombination of things from before.</p>\n<p>Sad to say, but anymore these days <em>Yo <strong><strong>NO</strong></strong> quiero Taco Bell</em>.</p>",
