        "created_at": "2024-11-14T14:27:54.463Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Nope, they flat out discontinued it.</p>\n<p>They did make a replacement cake-like product which is actually still really good… but they also only sell it very sporadically. Sigh.</p>\n<p>(Or at least they only ship it to where I live sporadically. Honestly there was a bunch of other food items I could have listed, but those ones I’m unsure if they’re actually discontinued or if they just don’t ship them out anymore to where I live in the boonies.)</p>",
